From 6ec1944268d7af550576de31d8a71fe1a257ead5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 17:03:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 859/913] module: power_domain: fix dead check and NULL parent
 dereference
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

connect_pd_tree() tested the pointer returned by taking the address of a
power domain table entry against NULL, which can never be true, so the
error path was dead code. Drop the test.

In process_set_state_request(), the loop walking the power domain tree
downwards dereferences pd->parent without checking it, while the root
power domain has a NULL parent. Stop the walk on a NULL parent and abort
the request instead of dereferencing NULL.

Coverity issue: CID 1200499: Logically dead code in connect_pd_tree
Coverity issue: CID 1200386: Dereference of potentially null field in process_set_state_request

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 31b978deaf91edb91a6178209ca62e9a76f472ef module: power_domain: fix dead check and NULL parent dereference]
Assisted-by: GitHub-Copilot:Claude-Opus-5
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I0dd30c8b83274cb5ac7d561fd926fca869452f62
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/SCP-firmware/+/596851
Reviewed-by: Valentin CARON <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 .../module/power_domain/src/mod_power_domain.c       | 12 ++++++++----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/power_domain/src/mod_power_domain.c b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/power_domain/src/mod_power_domain.c
index ec4402cec..17e336517 100644
--- a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/power_domain/src/mod_power_domain.c
+++ b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/power_domain/src/mod_power_domain.c
@@ -99,9 +99,6 @@ static int connect_pd_tree(void)
         }
 
         parent = pd->parent = &mod_pd_ctx.pd_ctx_table[pd->config->parent_idx];
-        if (parent == NULL) {
-            return FWK_E_DATA;
-        }
         fwk_list_push_tail(&parent->children_list, &pd->child_node);
     }
 
@@ -252,12 +249,19 @@ static void process_set_state_request(
              * next power domain to process as well as its level.
              */
             pd = lowest_pd;
-            for (level = lowest_level; level < (highest_level - pd_index);
+            for (level = lowest_level;
+                 (level < (highest_level - pd_index)) && (pd != NULL);
                  level++) {
                 pd = pd->parent;
             }
         }
 
+        /* The tree is shallower than the requested level */
+        if (pd == NULL) {
+            status = FWK_E_PARAM;
+            break;
+        }
+
         if (composite_state_operation) {
             state = get_level_state_from_composite_state(
                 state_mask_table, composite_state, (int)level);
-- 
